{"version":1,"content":"<p>車婉婉、徐榮、李偉健、李茵彤、何依婷與侯雋熙，今天（14日）拍攝處境劇《愛‧回家之三代同糖》。</p><p>盛傳向其他台處境劇示好、惹來公司不滿被安排「淡出」該劇的吳若希，則沒有同場現身。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.388652+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T12:01:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:17:38.344702+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"208f5c0d37710e79df60d73c148363afe92960553cf79797dbef439c30eccde7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}